<BRK/>
<OLI>Manufacturer's name, model number, serial number, Federal Stock Number (if any).</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Automatic Pump Controls</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Includes Pressure Indicating Transmitters, Flow Switches, Venturi Tubes, Differential Pressure Transmitters.</TXT><BRK/>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>Manufacturer's descriptive literature, general.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Parts manual.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
