identification in the field; part numbers of all control devices; normally open or normally closed; voltage 
of all control components.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Name, address and telephone number of the nearest manufacturer's representative.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
